{%- comment -%}
  Hardware and sim requirements, shared by the Guido product page and the
  install landing page.

  Set guido_roadmap_href before including when the roadmap lives on another
  page, e.g. '/products/guido/#roadmap' from the install page. Defaults to the
  in-page anchor the product page uses.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign guido_roadmap_href = guido_roadmap_href | default: '#roadmap' -%}
<section class="product-requirements">
  <div class="product-requirements-card">
    <h3>What you need</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Gran Turismo 7 running on a PS5, with telemetry enabled in the game settings — the sim supported today</li>
      <li>A phone or tablet on the same home network, running Android 7.0 or newer — best mounted beside your wheel</li>
      <li>That's it. No cables, no cloud, no account required for the Free tier</li>
      <li>More sims are on the <a href="{{ guido_roadmap_href }}">roadmap</a> — Guido is built for multiple sims</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
